[[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238915\">7050A20</a></p><p>1. Unscrew anchorage link screw.</p><p>2. Remove anchorage link.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019514.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check tie rod is not damaged.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>If safety belt has been subjected\nto a strong stress for example, it has to be replaced completely together\nwith anchorage and its fixing screws. In fact, although it doesn&#x27;t\nseem to have visible  defects, it could have losen its resistance\n characteristics.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>Reassembly anchorage link.</p><p>Tighten screw to  the prescribed couple.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>REAR SEAT BELT BRANCH WITH ATTACHMENT BUCKLE...</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>3.6 - 4.4</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/3238915\">7050A20</a></p>"]]